      "Yesoul publishes a continuous motor rating, 2.0 HP, as well as the 4.5 HP peak",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Mirroring screen only; native apps and the touchscreen are on the T5 Max",
      "About 222 lb assembled, with an 11 in. deck height",
