            Updated November 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Yesoul Treadmills: <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">A Buyer’s Guide to the T3S Plus and T5</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Yesoul made its name with screen-equipped exercise bikes and now sells two quite different treadmill lines in the US: the folding T3S Plus with a 21.5-inch screen, and the new T5 series with a 60-inch deck and a 30% incline. This guide sets out what each costs on the day, which figures we could confirm, and what the trial, return and warranty terms actually say.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#short-answer" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            The Short Answer
          </a>
          <a href="#current-range" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm border border-white/20">
            The Current Range
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- Author & Meta -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 py-8 border-b border-gray-100">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="48" height="48" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full" />
        <div>
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight"><a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author" class="text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-tight">Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-8 bg-gray-200"></div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
          Last Updated: <strong class="text-gray-700">November 5, 2026</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="1.3k" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose my-10 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gray-900">What we checked, and what we have not done.</strong> On
          5 November 2026 we read every treadmill and walking-pad listing in Yesoul’s US store
          (yesoulfitness.com), including the price each showed that day and whether it could be ordered, the
          specification tables on the T3S Plus, T5 Plus, T5 Max and T5 Ultra pages and the T5 Max specification
          page, and Yesoul’s refund, shipping and warranty text. We compared those with independent sources:
          Best Buy’s listings for the T3S Plus, a 31 October 2026 comparison published by Sole (a competing
          treadmill maker, so not neutral), Consumer Reports’ listing of the T3S Plus in its treadmill ratings
          (behind a paywall we did not pass), and the US Consumer Product Safety Commission’s recall database.
          Best Buy’s and Amazon’s product pages would not load for us that day, so their prices are quoted only
          where search results showed them. Figures on the product cards are those on which Yesoul and at least
          one independent source agree; the rest are attributed to Yesoul in the text. We have not tested a
          Yesoul treadmill. Prices change often, so confirm them before you order. As an Amazon Associate we earn
          from qualifying purchases.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-8">
      <div class="not-prose bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-3">Our Top Picks</h2>
        <ul class="list-none m-0 p-0">
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best Value Screen:</span>
            <a href="#yesoul-t3s-plus" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Yesoul T3S Plus</a>
            <a href="#yesoul-t3s-plus" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
