            <a href="#yesoul-t5-ultra" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#FF5A1F]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"></path></svg>
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#short-answer" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. Is a Yesoul Treadmill Worth Buying? The Short Answer</a>
          <a href="#who-yesoul-is" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. Who Yesoul Is, and Where It Sells</a>
          <a href="#current-range" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. The Yesoul Treadmill Range on 5 November 2026</a>
          <a href="#t3s-plus" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Yesoul T3S Plus Review: What the Figures Say</a>
          <a href="#t5-series" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. The Yesoul T5 Series: Plus, Max and Ultra</a>
          <a href="#warranty-returns" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. Yesoul Warranty, Home Trial and Returns</a>
